{comment}
  A landing page on the bare layout: the page's title as its heading, then its body as written. Assigned to a whole
  site section (its template), so every page of that site renders this way.
{endcomment}{include:`layouts/bare.html.dtmpl`}
  {fill:content}
    <h1>{var:page.title}</h1>
    {var:page.body raw}
  {endfill}
{endinclude}
